        "text": "SHIPPED — PR #329, merged into main at 3984e98 (branch fix/ai-boss-standoff, deleted).\n\nRoot cause: a bullet connects at the boss's HULL, but both DoAIFire's range test (2008 code) and the card-b56633fb approach anchor compared gun range to the boss's CENTRE distance — so the bot refused shots that would land and parked a large fraction of the hull nearer than its bullets required (brainboss rig: 104px mean edge where ~198px is the honest standoff).\n\nFix: PlayerShip.ShotReachCredit — the MIN of the collision box's four face distances measured from Position (offset-aware: BrainBoss's box sits 55*scale above Position, credit 80px; MarsBoss ~67px) — added to gun range in BOTH the fire gate (one Reach() definition) and the approach anchor, in lockstep. Scoped to IsAiPriorityTarget bosses on measurement: crediting every target read worse on both boss rigs (+27% powerup-economy shift on the spider rig); scoped, the spider rig is byte-identical by construction. New seam ?aishotreach=<0..1> (0 = pre-card centre test).\n\nMeasured (eahl, Very_Hard, paired seeds — cheap-tier N, the N=60 gate runs in the scoring pass):\n- brainboss (1-4 x2, post-merge HEAD): boss= 104 -> 178px, deaths 5.00 -> 2.75 (outside 2 SEM), PlasmaBall deaths 14 -> ~2, idle 13.8 -> 6.5%\n- marsboss (1-4 x2, post-merge HEAD): boss= 157 -> 171px, deaths 13.25 -> 11.25 (within SEM), victories 2/8 -> 4/8, win@161s -> 144s, idle 15.5 -> 1.2%, bossfar 18 -> 1.2%\n- spider (1-8 x2): identical arms, SpiderBoss(standing) unchanged\n\nVerification: logic_probe green incl. new ProbeAiShotReach (pins min-of-faces on real BrainBoss geometry, circle branch, scale arms) + ProbeAiBossApproach swept at both credit extremes; probe suite 60/60 on the merged tree; ai_boss_approach.txt gained a mutation-tested boss= >= 160px band the ?aishotreach=0 arm fails (181 vs 143px). Peer review: 10 findings, all actioned (finding 1 — offset-aware credit — changed behaviour and was re-measured).\n\nDocs: web CLAUD